Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Day three already... it's going so fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.96,0:00:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure you're not tired, Nono-pi?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine since we're not cosplaying today.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just here for Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as you're all okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.08,0:00:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm busy on Day Three,\Nso I won't be joining you,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but as the Cosplay Club advisor,\NI need to give you a word of advice.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're the Manga Club, Sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.63,0:00:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you're going,\Nthere's one cosplayer you have to go see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.04,0:00:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.96,0:00:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right! I wanted to get a copy of her cosrom.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.46,0:00:36.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go! Where to first?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.25,0:00:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Sensei was that insistent, she's gotta be big...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.25,0:00:39.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go! Where to first?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.54,0:00:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Senpai, is that the same hat?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.83,0:00:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope, the one Sensei signed\Nis too precious to wear now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing the extra one I bought just in case.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't he say they only made ten of those?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Aria-chan,\NI thought you were supposed to visit family today.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.63,0:00:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was the plan,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.83,0:00:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,but we're going tomorrow instead.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got old.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.67,0:01:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go! Ririsa's got stuff to buy!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Liliel gang!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.96,0:03:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard about what happened.\NGreat job yesterday!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.29,0:03:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!\NCan I get your new cosrom, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.04,0:03:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! This one's for all ages.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.29,0:03:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't need to pay.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.00,0:03:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.58,0:03:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino, that's 2000 yen.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.71,0:03:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I take it I'll be purchasing it for you, then?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.25,0:03:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just get me a copy of your new cosrom.\NWe'll call it a trade!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.88,0:03:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.75,0:03:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, Liliel-chan! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I saw you online! So glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Sorry to cause so much drama.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I buy your new cosrom?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.63,0:03:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That'll be 2000 yen for the full set.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm busy on Day Three. I'm busy on Day Three.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.50,0:03:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.04,0:03:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm on a date!\NThis is my day off, so who cares?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.29,0:03:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't say no to a date, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.29,0:03:58.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Eri needed help at the booth, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.79,0:04:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kids, but I get to play with Mayuri-sensei today.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.21,0:04:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound dirty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.92,0:04:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,After this, we're going to that one café\Nthat has god-tier service just for Comiket,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,then a karaoke after party,\Nthen a cosplay rave.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing dirty happening here!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, these kids won't know what a cosplay rave is.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.96,0:04:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The cosrom you're looking for is over at that booth.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no line right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that the cosplayer you\Nwanted to see, Ririsa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.46,0:04:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.50,0:04:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She spends a whole year making her\Ncostume and sculpting her body for a character,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.75,0:04:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we only see her once\Na year at Summer Comiket.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Five-star rarity, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Ririsa's this excited...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.25,0:04:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then what's she like?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.46,0:04:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,One copy of your newest release!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.13,0:04:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.63,0:04:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That'll be 5000 yen for the set.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I like the costume, but what cosplay is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just helping out!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.67,0:04:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's up on the roof getting photos taken right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, well!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it isn't Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're Nyaru-chan from NekoConnect!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you just getting finished with photos?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup, sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.04,0:05:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I wouldn't mind sticking around\Nif Kai-sama wanted a few shots!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.42,0:05:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.50,0:05:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things are chaotic enough up here as it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so something the broody\NKai-sama would've said at the start of his arc!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.50,0:05:21.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta play the game right and keep\Ntalking to him every time he shows up!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is she?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.58,0:05:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why is she looking at him like that?!\NI'll show her!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.21,0:05:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's such good friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.25,0:05:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's her new cosrom.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.79,0:05:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can find her beyond that crowd over there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though my crowd was totally bigger than hers!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.46,0:05:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't care that much about\Ndrawing big crowds or selling tons of cosroms.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's just dedicated...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,...to the art of cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.79,0:05:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mayura.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.88,0:05:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were you guys talking about the Heavenly Queen?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.38,0:06:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want Ririsa and the gang to see\Nher as what they should aspire towards.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because she's not interested in popularity.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's all about defining cosplay as an art form.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.50,0:06:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Erika-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.67,0:06:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photographers might think Nagomi's\Nthe best cosplayer out there...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.13,0:06:23.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, cosplayers would choose her instead.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.67,0:06:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's the closest anyone's gotten to being truly 2D.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.50,0:06:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Queen Erika Awayuki.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.38,0:06:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.96,0:06:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The costume, the wig, the details and props,\Neven the shape of her body,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,everything is a perfect replica of the original!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.29,0:06:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't think this precision was humanly possible!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.08,0:06:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I put tons of work into being the best Liliel,\Nbut I'm nowhere close to looking like the original!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.17,0:06:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel's arms and waist are way slimmer,\Nand her boobs are bigger!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.96,0:06:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not even close.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.13,0:07:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do I get to her level?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.75,0:07:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I thought I looked good!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.46,0:07:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still have so much more to improve upon!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.17,0:07:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're already really good.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got our application form for Winter Comiket!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put together a cosrom and sell it there!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to do this again with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.63,0:07:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You already got what you came for, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.46,0:07:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't really have a reason to keep cosplaying.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.71,0:07:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.25,0:07:41.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, is that what you want, Nono-pi?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.17,0:07:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,For me to stop cosplaying with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I mean, why ask me...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.38,0:07:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm done, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.17,0:07:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.04,0:07:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You told Ririsa how you feel. Now tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.58,0:08:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to stop!\NI thought we were friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.63,0:08:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.67,0:08:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.17,0:08:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I had so much fun cosplaying with you guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.71,0:08:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to cosplay with you again, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were gonna keep cosplaying\Nno matter what I said!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not getting rid of me yet, Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're stuck together forever!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.88,Q6,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're stuck together forever!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's from Mom.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So your parents are cool?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.63,0:09:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Oh, and Dad made his deadline.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you guys enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, it was mostly Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.92,0:09:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.63,0:09:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The manga you made,\Nthe manga you created, made me happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.50,0:09:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it without you, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.67,0:09:35.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I've got even more competition!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.00,0:09:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we're all such good friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.79,0:09:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, who's ready for Day Four tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have work!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.46,0:09:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm out of town.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I please sleep in, Ririsa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just me and Ririsa today.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.00,0:10:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of the first time we went to an event.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.54,0:10:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's the last day!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.42,0:10:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since it's been just the two of us, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, y-yeah, huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're on a date!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.88,0:10:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is totally a Comiket date!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.25,0:10:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does my heart start racing\Nwhenever I'm alone with him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.96,0:10:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I love Senpai, but not like that!\NHe's just a friend!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.96,0:10:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.54,0:10:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our first event felt like a date,\Nbut we got through it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need to freak out.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.71,0:10:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's with the suitcase?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! I brought something to\Nchange into once we get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.63,0:11:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ever since my first Comiket,\NI've wanted to shop the floor in costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.63,0:11:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the courage to do it alone,\Nbut with you, I thought...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.25,0:11:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that the one cosplayer?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.29,0:11:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Liliel...\NAren't people going to think we're like, together?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.29,0:11:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers can have boyfriends! We're not idols.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.46,0:11:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow. I didn't expect you to have\Nan immediate counter for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.29,0:11:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kinda wouldn't mind if people\Nthought we were together.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.75,0:11:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that supposed to mean, Liliel?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.75,0:11:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.50,0:11:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought that might weird you out.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.67,0:11:52.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's totally fine...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I brought this for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel... When did you make this?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.54,0:12:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd make a great Ashford-sama!\NYou could totally be the next Heavenly King!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll pass, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.88,0:12:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their costumes are so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.88,0:12:15.25,Q6,,0,0,0,,Look, Ash and Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.67,0:12:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right. We're not a couple,\Nwe're just a cosplay group.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That'll make walking around less awkward!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.83,0:12:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I buy a copy?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! That'll be 800 yen.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.29,0:12:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew when I got back into\NAshLili that it's pretty obscure now,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I thought I'd sell at least one copy...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should've just done something for\NHellmaids like everyone else...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.13,0:12:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might I take a look through your book?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-y-yeah, sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.83,0:12:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel and Ash-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.08,0:12:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, in the flesh, at my booth!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.13,0:12:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so freaking cute! Is this real life?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Ash-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.13,0:13:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tales of our adventures sure have traveled far!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.42,0:13:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did not expect to find a\Npicture book exposition here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Always interesting, these port towns.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're in character on an adventure!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.96,0:13:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This book tells the story of our romance.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.08,0:13:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.58,0:13:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they're totally flirting! I love them so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,May I have a copy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,One for me too, madam.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! It's free for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.17,0:13:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all right, we'll pay!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.88,0:13:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I saw a Liliel cosplay, uh,\Na photo of you, online back in May.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.67,0:13:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's what inspired me to draw this.\NI did it for the fandom, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.17,0:13:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you don't need to pay.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.08,0:13:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Consider this a trade.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.42,0:13:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.17,0:14:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt so connected with the Liliel fandom today!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.96,0:14:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone was so happy to see Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.21,0:14:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.21,0:14:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most of the time, we're either studying for school,\Nor geeking out about anime and manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.83,0:14:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not every day we get the opportunity\Nto make other people happy like you did.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.79,0:14:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're amazing,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! It felt right in the moment,\NI just didn't think!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.29,0:14:42.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're amazing, Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.13,0:14:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just cosplay because I think it's cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the one who accepted\Nme without any judgment.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I only started cosplaying because of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.67,0:15:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Together, we'll make it happen!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.63,0:15:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made my first cosrom because of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.08,0:15:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.50,0:15:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I was about to give up,\Nyou gave me the strength to keep going.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.33,0:15:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd be nothing without you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.21,0:15:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the reason I'm so amazing. It's you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.29,0:15:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't help it. I love him so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it because he's Ash-sama right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.33,0:15:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't think of him like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.38,0:15:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't like him as just a friend.\NMaybe it's...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.42,0:15:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lo...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.46,0:16:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You dropped part of your costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.58,0:16:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.08,0:16:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I have mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.79,0:16:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ashford-sama?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.21,0:16:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,One moment, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.79,0:16:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is my first time in Japan.\NThis is my first time...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.63,0:16:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.54,0:16:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Xiaoyu! I'm a cosplayer,\Nand this is my first time in Japan!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.58,0:16:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You came all the way here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.83,0:16:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lots of people travel to come to Comiket!\NIt's famous!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.04,0:16:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And we all love Japanese manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited! I've never met another Liliel fan!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.75,0:16:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm excited, too!\NIt's so cool that Liliel has fans outside Japan, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.83,0:16:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the Side Story outfit! It's so cute.\NI love the bare shoulders!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love the thicker material on her original outfit!\NDid you make it yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.25,0:17:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The joy of finding a fellow otaku\Ncrosses all languages and borders.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.42,0:17:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!\NCan we take some pictures together?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.75,0:17:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be against canon, Ririsa?\NThere's never two Liliels.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.29,0:17:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right, that's never happened in canon!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.29,0:17:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\NTwo Liliels will make some really fun photos!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.67,0:17:29.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.96,0:17:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.46,0:17:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The other day, I got so caught up with\Nstaying in character that I passed out.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.50,0:17:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, the whole reason I like staying in\Ncharacter is because that's more fun for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.17,0:17:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be a stickler if it ruins that fun!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.29,0:17:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it if it makes me miss\Nout on a once-in-a-lifetime chance!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Xiaoyu-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.25,0:17:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's go up to the photo area!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool. I'll go do my own thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to come with us, Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.13,0:18:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.04,0:18:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boy, that takes me back! Lord Ashford and...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.13,0:18:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Two Liliels?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.83,0:18:11.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's that one Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.29,0:18:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're famous!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're famous!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone rushed in to get pictures!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.92,0:18:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never guessed I'd be doing this today...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.08,0:18:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, refusing would be an insult to Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.17,0:18:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai's into it!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.96,0:18:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone here taught me that cosplay\Nis nothing to be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.88,0:18:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ash-sama and Liliel would totally go like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.42,0:18:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai's with another Liliel?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does it feel so wrong?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.54,0:18:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.04,0:19:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is she jealous?!\NAre you jealous, Ririsa?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.71,0:19:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are the two Liliels fighting over Ash?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did that ever happen in the manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a bit out of character.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a deep cut.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.71,0:19:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It must be a metaphor for how Liliel feels\Ntorn between duty and her love for Ash.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.29,0:19:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,One's wearing her original costume,\Nthe other is wearing her spin-off costume.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.38,0:19:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen such an advanced\Nexpression of fandom through cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so smart.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.04,0:19:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's our Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.38,0:19:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stellar work.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I had so much fun today!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.13,0:19:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You helped me learn something\Nnew about myself, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I get a few photos with you, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.08,0:20:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you seem kinda\Nworked up about Xiaoyu's Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.33,0:20:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just nervous! I get shy with strangers!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.92,0:20:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know you, so I'm comfortable with you, and...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.96,0:20:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the only Liliel for me!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.25,0:20:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Don't worry, I won't steal your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.25,0:20:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I meant!\NAnd he's not my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.88,0:20:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, get together, I'll take a picture!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.13,0:20:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Closer, c'mon!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the cutest couple in all of Japan!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.42,0:20:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to go now.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.67,0:20:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much for today! I'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.96,0:20:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope we'll see you again at another event!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.21,0:20:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't promise you will.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.08,0:20:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.42,0:21:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I'll be able to come to Japan again.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This country is wonderful.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.50,0:21:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone can make amazing manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.29,0:21:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing is off-limits!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.25,0:21:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take care of Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And please take care...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.42,0:21:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,...of this wonderful world.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Comiket's over.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's all fired up!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, just...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.79,0:21:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You put so much energy into\Neverything for this Comiket.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.33,0:21:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was a little worried you'd be\Ncompletely drained by the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.63,0:21:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.58,0:21:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna waste\Na single day from here on out!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.25,0:21:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The moment I get home,\NI'm gonna start brainstorming my next cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.17,0:21:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds good.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.79,0:22:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,My waifu is 2D.\NI'm not interested in 3D girls.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.08,0:22:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.38,0:22:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,2.5D might be okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.58,0:22:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not in love!\NI am definitely not in love with her!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.21,0:22:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But before I realized it,\NI had fallen in love with this wonderful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:56.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,403.2)}{\an7}This Wonderful World
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.71,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,525.6)}{\an7}plain girls with glasses RULE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:11.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,64.8)}{\an7}will suffer collateral damage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.17,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,151.2)}{\an7}Comic Market 99 Circle Application
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:52.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,619.2)}{\an7}Remember this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:51.00,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,57.6)}{\an7}AAAAAAAAAAAAAA
